{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"58721c4c81e84430fff62a1b233e41a608284b0b851fb9a8d469702bd1c5623e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我若能说万人的方言，并天使的话语，却没有爱，我就成了鸣的锣，响的钹一般。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我若有先知讲道之能，也明白各样的奥秘，各样的知识，而且有全备的信，叫我能够移山，却没有爱，我就算不得什么。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我若将所有的周济穷人，又舍己身叫人焚烧，却没有爱，仍然与我无益。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["爱是恒久忍耐，又有恩慈；爱是不嫉妒；爱是不自夸，不张狂，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["不做害羞的事，不求自己的益处，不轻易发怒，不计算人的恶，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["不喜欢不义，只喜欢真理；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["凡事包容，凡事相信，凡事盼望，凡事忍耐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["爱是永不止息。先知讲道之能终必归于无有；说方言之能终必停止；知识也终必归于无有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我们现在所知道的有限，先知所讲的也有限，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["等那完全的来到，这有限的必归于无有了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我作孩子的时候，话语像孩子，心思像孩子，意念像孩子，既成了人，就把孩子的事丢弃了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们如今仿佛对着镜子观看，模糊不清",{"noteId":7},"，到那时就要面对面了。我如今所知道的有限，到那时就全知道，如同主知道我一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["如今常存的有信，有望，有爱这三样，其中最大的是爱。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"原文是如同猜谜","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}